            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Changes

- Action items has the same period list as the Dashboard on its right: click Today, Last week or a month to jump there.
- The period and category lists grow and shrink with the window: wider in a wide window, with more room between the names in a tall one.
- On Action items, an item's owner, due date, Urgent and Mine controls stack neatly in a narrow window instead of squeezing their text.
]]></description>
